{"ID":"20240205153824-pbgazul","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153824-pbgazul","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153824-pbgazul\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206093141-twrn13l\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611142622-8902fwl\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240624152556-6bublc0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:13,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:13\u0026#125;","title":"168玄参（黑参）","type":"doc","updated":"20240205160130"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206093141-twrn13l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206093141-twrn13l","updated":"20240206093144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产川渝地区、陕西、湖北、江西等地。\n【性状】\t根类圆柱形，中间略粗或上粗下细，有的微弯曲，长620cm，直径13cm。表面灰黄色或灰褐色，有不规则的纵沟、横向皮孔及稀疏的横裂纹和须根痕。质坚实，不易折断，断面黑色，微有光泽。气特异似焦糖，味甘、微苦、咸。\n【性味】\t甘、苦、咸，微寒。\n【功效】\t清热凉血，泻火解毒，滋阴。用于温邪入营，内陷心包，温毒发斑，热病伤阴、舌绛烦渴、津伤便秘、骨蒸劳嗽、目赤、咽痛、瘰疬、白喉、痈肿疮毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240206093134-7hra9v1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206093134-7hra9v1","updated":"20240206093134"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206093134-ye1kw46.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205160130-rzfc1is","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205160130-rzfc1is","updated":"20240205160130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 649px;","style":"width: 639px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"玄参"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/玄参-20240205160130-b9mte5h.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 639px;\" parent-style=\"width: 649px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205160130-85n9psb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205160130-85n9psb","updated":"20240205160130"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 650px;","style":"width: 640px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"玄参2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/玄参2-20240205160130-y11eugp.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 640px;\" parent-style=\"width: 650px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240624151558-ubd2xy0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624151558-ubd2xy0","updated":"20240814092930"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 447px;","style":"width: 437px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"玄参2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/玄参2-20240624151835-xnqecp9.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 437px;\" parent-style=\"width: 447px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240814093016-i5m76xu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240814093016-i5m76xu","updated":"20240814095635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 447px;","style":"width: 437px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"玄参"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/玄参-20240814093016-kmo5io3.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen